---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = "May 22, 2025";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for Sushi BBY.">
  <section class="privacy">
    <div class="privacy-inner">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="privacy-meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how Sushi BBY ("we," "us," or "our")
        collects, uses, and shares information about you when you visit our
        website or make a reservation with us.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        We collect information you provide directly to us, such as when you
        submit a reservation request or contact us by email. This may include
        your name, email address, phone number, and any special requests or
        dietary notes you choose to share.
      </p>
      <p>
        We may also collect certain information automatically when you visit
        our website, including your IP address, browser type, pages visited,
        and the date and time of your visit. This data is used solely for
        analytics and to improve site performance.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Process and confirm your reservation requests</li>
        <li>Communicate with you about your visit</li>
        <li>Respond to inquiries and customer service requests</li>
        <li>Improve and maintain our website</li>
        <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Sharing Your Information</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third
        parties. We may share your information with trusted service providers
        who assist us in operating our website and managing reservations (such
        as OpenTable Resy), subject to confidentiality agreements. We may
        also disclose information when required by law or to protect our rights.
      </p>

      <h2>Reservation Platforms</h2>
      <p>
        Reservations made through OpenTable or Resy are subject to those
        platforms' own privacy policies in addition to this one. We encourage
        you to review their policies before booking.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may use cookies or similar tracking technologies to
        enhance your browsing experience and collect usage data. You can
        instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a
        cookie is being sent. Some features of the site may not function
        properly without cookies.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain personal information only for as long as necessary to
        fulfill the purposes outlined in this policy, or as required by law.
        Reservation records may be kept for up to two years for operational
        and legal purposes.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal
        information we hold about you by contacting us at the email address
        below. We will respond to all requests within a reasonable timeframe.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is not directed to children under the age of 13. We do
        not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you
        believe we have inadvertently collected such information, please
        contact us immediately.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we
        will revise the "last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued
        use of our website after any changes constitutes your acceptance of
        the updated policy.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact
        us at <a href="mailto:sushibbynj@gmail.com">contact@sushi-bby.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy {
    padding: 5rem var(--pad-x);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .privacy-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .privacy-inner h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-meta {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .privacy-inner h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .privacy-inner p,
  .privacy-inner li {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .privacy-inner ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }

  .privacy-inner a {
    color: var(--color-link);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
